  "ai.orion81Builds": "I-Orion-81 yakhelwe phezu kwesoftware evulekileyo ebhalwe ngabantu. Ibalwe lapha ngoba ayenziwanga yi-AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ngumsebenzi owenziwe wonke yi-AI.<\/0> Umugqa ngamunye wekhodi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo wabhalwa nge-Claude Code, kuqondiswa ngumsunguli. Umkhumbi ngamunye, imephu, i-texture lomsindo kwakhiwa ngamathuluzi abhalwa yi-Claude Code. Umsunguli unquma okuzakhiwa; i-Claude Code ithola ukuthi kwenziwa njani. Amalayibrari avulekileyo ayakhelwe kuwo atholakala ngaphansi kwethi 'Akwenziwanga yi-AI'. Into eyodwa isavuliwe futhi ikhonjiswa obala: <1>ukuhlolwa kwelayisense<\/1> yekhodi yomdlalo eyadluliselwa evela kusifanekiselo sokuqala se-GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I-Orion yaqala mhlaka-28 September 2026 njengesifanekiselo sokuqala senjini evulekileyo ye-Quake III Arena (GPL), imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous iyisikhuthazo sayo. Ngosuku lwesibili ikhodi yomdlalo yathuthela ku-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; amamojuli omdlalo adluliselwa evela kusifanekiselo sokuqala aphinda aqanjwa amagama amatsha. Inguqulo 0.3.0 yanikela zonke izinhlobo ezingu-16 zemikhumbi imizimba emitsha eyayo. Ukuhlolwa kokulandela umthetho welayisense kuhlola ukuthi ngabe kukhona ikhodi esatholakala ku-GPL yokuqala yini, lokuthi amadizayini okuqala emikhumbi awasondelene yini kakhulu lesikhuthazo sawo. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelayo kokufana kwekhodi lomthombo wesifanekiselo sokuqala se-GPL kwenziwa mhlaka-8 October 2026, ukuhlolwa kwabochwepheshe kwezifaniso zako kuyaqhubeka. Konke okutholakala kuthathwe kuzabhalwa kutsha kumbe kudizayinwe kutsha.",
