  "d.10azxrl": "Amaradiyasi amathathu elanga ngaphezu kwefotosfiya. Umthunzi uyikuphila: isihlangu senkundla, ikhomethi, imizimba emikhulu. Amalangabi avela njalo emizuzwini embalwa.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Umbala wokuzenzela umkhando wawo ogqamile ungaphansi kuka-0x40 ufundwa njenge-STOCK, ngakho isihlangu singalokothi singabonakali.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "AMAROKHETHI",
