  "economy.todayHead": "Okukhona lamuhla",
  "economy.todayLead": "Amazinga omzimba lesihlangu lemibala yesihlangu esikrinini se-LOADOUT (0.6.0) akhombisa uhlobo lokuthuthukiswa lezinto zokuhlobisa umnotho ohlosiwe ukunikela.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Ngoba imali yawo ihlosiwe ukubahlawula. Umdlalo uqala wenziwe wonke yi-AI ukuze ube khona kwakhona; abakhi bemidwebo abahlawulwayo bese bethatha indawo yomsebenzi we-AI, bebizwa ngamagama.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ngingadlala ku-inthanethi yini?",
  "faq.freePlay": "Ukudlala kumahala yini?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Imibuzo",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Hatshi okwamanje. Umdlalo wabadlali abanengi we-LAN kunethiwekhi efanayo uyasebenza lamuhla (kusukela ku-0.2.0); ukudlala ku-inthanethi akukakhiwa.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "Isifanekiselo sokuqala sakhiwa kunjini evulekileyo ye-Quake III Arena (GPL) futhi sathatha imikhumbi ye-Elite Dangerous njengesikhuthazo. Ngosuku lwesibili ikhodi yomdlalo yathuthela ku-BuB, injini entsha ebhalwe nge-Claude Code; amamojuli omdlalo adluliselwa evela kusifanekiselo sokuqala aphinda aqanjwa amagama amatsha. Inguqulo 0.3.0 yanikela zonke izinhlobo ezingu-16 zemikhumbi imizimba emitsha. Ukuhlolwa kokulandela umthetho welayisense kuhlola ukuthi ngabe kukhona ikhodi esatholakala ku-GPL yokuqala yini, lokuthi amadizayini okuqala emikhumbi awasondelene yini kakhulu lesikhuthazo sawo. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelayo kokufana kwekhodi lomthombo wesifanekiselo sokuqala se-GPL kwenziwa mhlaka-<0/>, futhi ukuhlolwa kwabochwepheshe kwezifaniso zako kuyaqhubeka. Konke okutholakala kuthathwe kuzabhalwa kutsha kumbe kudizayinwe kutsha. Kuze kuphele ukuhlolwa, kasitsho ukuthi impendulo ithi hatshi.",
  "faq.questions": "Imibuzo",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Imikhumbi, ubuciko, isixhumanisi lokunye, njengoba imali ivumela. <0>Incwadi yaleli khasi<\/0> ibala yonke into izakhombisa ukuthathelwa kwayo kwendawo kanye lomdwebi wayo.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "Imikhumbi lokuthuthukiswa kuhlelelwe ukuthi kutholakale ngokudlala kumbe kuthengwe. Indlela imikhumbi ehlawulelwayo egcina ilungile ngayo empini yomdlali lomdlali isaqanjwa.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Yilo uhlelo: kudlalwa mahala ngemali yasemdlalweni ekhethwayo lezinto zokuhlobisa. Akukakhiwa.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "Ingabe kukhona umsebenzi womuntu okhopishiweyo?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Uphuma nini, futhi kusetshenziswa ini?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Yiziphi izingxenye abantu abazozithatha, futhi ngizakwazi kanjani?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "Kungani umdlalo owenziwe yi-AI ungasiza abakhi bemidwebo?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Uzakuba kuhlawulelwa ukuwina yini?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "Windows PC. Akukho suku lokuphuma futhi akukabi lamba.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude le-Claude Code yizimpawu zokuthengisa ze-Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine le-Epic Games yizimpawu zokuthengisa ze-Epic Games, Inc. I-Blender yimpawu yokuthengisa ye-Blender Foundation. I-Quake III Arena le-Elite Dangerous yizimpawu zokuthengisa zabanikazi bazo. Wonke amagama ngawabanikazi bawo futhi asetshenziswa kuphela ukuhlonza imikhiqizo ebizwayo. I-Orion-81 kayihlobene, kayixhaswa kumbe kayivunywa muphi wabo.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Okuhlosiweyo. Akukho ubambiswano, ubudlelwano kumbe ukuvunywa okukhona.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Isiteshi siyeza",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Idevlog ku-YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Landela i-Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Abalingani bakusasa?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Akulabalandeli. Akulamakhukhi. Isayithi lokubuka kuqala. Isenzakalo ngasinye silandelwa egcinweni lomsebenzi; akukho lutho lapha olungumnikelo kumbe isethembiso.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Akukabi bukhoma",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Into eyodwa isavuliwe: <0>ukuhlolwa kwelayisense<\/0> yekhodi yomdlalo eyadluliselwa evela kusifanekiselo sokuqala se-GPL. Ukuskena okuzenzakalelayo kokufana kwekhodi lomthombo wesifanekiselo sokuqala kwenziwa mhlaka-<1/>, futhi ukuhlolwa kwabochwepheshe kwezifaniso zako kuyaqhubeka.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 ngumsebenzi owenziwe wonke yi-AI.<\/0> Ikhodi ye-Orion-81 ngokwayo yabhalwa nge-Claude Code, iqondiswa ngumsunguli; imikhumbi, amamephu, ama-texture lemisindo kwakhiwa ngamathuluzi i-Claude Code eyawabhalayo. Amalayibrari avulekileyo ewasebenzisayo atholakala ngaphansi kwethi <1>'Akwenziwanga yi-AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Unyawo lwesayithi",
